<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Assassins Guild</h1>
<p>The guild of the Khorsabad Assassins, the masters of the quick and silent 
kill, lies hidden in Khorsabad. Its head is Ja'afar, the Master Assassin, 
in the Guild Master's Room, and its trainers teach the assassins' skills, 
weapons and few spells.
</p><p>To join, stand before the Master and type <a cmd='#'>join</a>. Healers, paladins and 
druids are not welcome. First you must prove yourself worthy by finishing 
the Assassin Guild quest: the Master sends you to Sharki to begin it. To 
leave the guild, insult the Master; but a member who is banished can 
never come back.
</p><p>A thief who has joined, and has never specialized, can ask the Master to 
become an assassin: say "specialize" to him, and drink the grey ale he 
gives you. The change is permanent (see <a cmd='#'>Help Assassins</a>).
</p><p>Members who <a cmd='#'>worship</a> the Master are given the Death Bringer, a weapon 
for the work, and a dark talisman that shows they belong.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
